ed  although i was never anti-gay it's more  about the strange nature  of how tucker ended up getting into this  story earlier this week  doing this bizarre proactive segment to  attack  jeff bezos and to say people are  looking for dirt it's just all very  strange  now that being said yeah tucker's heroes  in college were really disturbing it's  not just  that he of the three groups he mentions  one  seems to be an adoration of the guy who  killed harvey milk for being gay  that's horrifying he also shouts out  jesse helms jesse helms used to be a  senator  who opposed the civil rights act opposed  the voting rights act called the civil  rights act  dangerous and on and on if these were  tucker's heroes then  i'd be curious as to who his heroes are  today it's really horrible stuff  i don't expect much more to come of it  you know anybody  oh he should be fired from fox news yeah  right even if fox news doesn't see this  as a feature  um it's not going to cause a problem for  tucker on fox news but a very strange  story and watching it develop it  watching it develop over the week  even stranger with the proactive oh  people are calling around looking for  dirt on me  really weird let me know what you make  of it i spend a lot of time every day  looking at a computer screen and  peer-reviewed studies have shown that  blue  light from screens can lead to eye  strain  blurred vision headaches dry watery eyes  that will not be a problem for you once  you get blue blocks  glasses which filter out blue light to  help your eyes  they are one of our sponsors today blue  blocks glasses are developed  and built in actual optics labs they've  been extensively tested for  effectiveness  there are over 40 different styles to  choose from  these are my blue blocks glasses i like  the look i've noticed a huge difference  where i'm not  getting that eye strain or the headaches  from the computer screen  because of the blue blocks glasses they  really have something for everyone a